            "tool": {
                "driver": {
                    "name": "trivy",
                    "version": "auto"
                }
            },
            "toolExecutionNotifications": [
                {
                    "level": "note",
                    "message": {
                        "text": "{\n  \"SchemaVersion\": 2,\n  \"Trivy\": {\n    \"Version\": \"0.72.0\"\n  },\n  \"ReportID\": \"019fd7ff-bc99-735b-a8b8-522e9fd1189c\",\n  \"CreatedAt\": \"2026-08-06T18:54:49.241221842+02:00\",\n  \"ArtifactID\": \"sha256:2721dd7eddde0444db396c158509fc93bfb26de0d6921818ad6f89274050d504\",\n  \"ArtifactName\": \".\",\n  \"ArtifactType\": \"repository\",\n  \"Metadata\": {\n    \"RepoURL\": \"https://github.com/milnet01/LocalWebServerManager.git\",\n    \"Branch\": \"main\",\n    \"Commit\": \"b7604b5fb26604cb9d22184838a74f854ba9e140\",\n    \"CommitMsg\": \"FP02: close the CI and gate findings from the review\\n\\nlocal-ci.sh — the CRITICAL one. actionlint and yamllint had shared a\\nsingle YAML_CHECKED flag, so with actionlint absent and yamllint present\\nthe flag was set by yamllint and suppressed the actionlint skip too: the\\nrun printed \\\"Local CI passed.\\\" with zero SKIPs and exit 0. Reproduced\\nwith stub executables on PATH, both before and after. Each tool now has\\nits own guard and its own skip, and the comment says what each actually\\ncovers — actionlint owns workflow semantics and shellcheck over every\\nrun: block, yamllint owns dependabot.yml, which actionlint never reads.\\nactionlint is the likeliest to be missing, having no distro package.\\n\\nlocal-ci.sh — a SKIP was advisory on every machine, so CI reported green\\non a degraded run. LWSM_REQUIRE_ALL_TOOLS=1 makes it fatal, and the\\nworkflow sets it. A developer's machine keeps the warning, because a\\nmissing linter should not stop someone testing their own change.\\n\\nlocal-ci.sh — every argument is parsed, not just $1: `--fst` used to run\\nthe full gate silently. Unknown arguments exit 2 with usage, and --help\\nexists. `set -E` now has the ERR trap that makes it mean something, so a\\nruff or pytest failure names the step that broke instead of exiting bare.\\nColour is suppressed when stdout is not a tty or NO_COLOR is set. Dropped\\n`|| true` from the unset, which hid the one case unset can fail.\\n\\nci.yml — setup-uv was unpinned, so CI resolved whatever uv was latest at\\nrun time (0.12.2 today) while this project is developed against 0.11.7:\\na floating reference of the kind dependencies.md § 6 forbids, and it made\\nthe script's \\\"Measured on uv 0.11.7\\\" comment describe a resolver CI does\\nnot run. Pinned to 0.11.7 rather than 0.12.2 deliberately — the resolver\\nwrites uv.lock, so both sides move in one commit or neither does. The\\nbump to 0.12.2 is filed separately.\\n\\nci.yml — the interpreter version was a check-affecting input living in\\nthe workflow instead of the shared script. .python-version is now\\ncommitted and the step reads it, so both machines resolve the same\\ninterpreter; requires-python is only a floor, and filterwarnings=error\\nturns any divergence into a red build that will not reproduce locally.\\n\\nci.yml — yamllint is installed rather than assumed from the runner image,\\nnow that a missing tool is fatal here. timeout-minutes: 15 replaces the\\n360-minute default on a job whose tests bind real sockets.\\ncancel-in-progress is limited to pull_request: this project pushes\\nstraight to main, so cancelling left the earlier commit permanently\\nungated. The setup-uv version comment moved inline, since dependabot\\nrewrites the trailing form and would have left a standalone one\\nasserting a version the pin no longer points at.\\n\\nVerified: actionlint, yamllint -d relaxed, zizmor and shellcheck all\\nclean, and the full gate run with LWSM_REQUIRE_ALL_TOOLS=1 exits 0.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \\u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\\u003e\",\n    \"Author\": \"Anthony Schemel \\u003caant.schemel@gmail.com\\u003e\",\n    \"Committer\": \"Anthony Schemel \\u003caant.schemel@gmail.com\\u003e\"\n  },\n  \"Results\": [\n    {\n      \"Target\": \"uv.lock\",\n      \"Class\": \"lang-pkgs\",\n      \"Type\": \"uv\",\n      \"Packages\": [\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"localwebservermanager@0.0.0\",\n          \"Name\": \"localwebservermanager\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/localwebservermanager@0.0.0\",\n            \"UID\": \"d032838be6fd9097\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"0.0.0\",\n          \"Relationship\": \"root\",\n          \"DependsOn\": [\n            \"psutil@7.2.2\",\n            \"pyside6@6.11.1\",\n            \"pytest-qt@4.5.0\",\n            \"pytest@9.1.1\",\n            \"ruff@0.16.1\"\n          ],\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"psutil@7.2.2\",\n          \"Name\": \"psutil\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/psutil@7.2.2\",\n            \"UID\": \"c4330f4611899889\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"7.2.2\",\n          \"Relationship\": \"direct\",\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"pyside6@6.11.1\",\n          \"Name\": \"pyside6\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/pyside6@6.11.1\",\n            \"UID\": \"c41f8b3cfcec759\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"6.11.1\",\n          \"Relationship\": \"direct\",\n          \"DependsOn\": [\n            \"pyside6-addons@6.11.1\",\n            \"pyside6-essentials@6.11.1\",\n            \"shiboken6@6.11.1\"\n          ],\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"pytest@9.1.1\",\n          \"Name\": \"pytest\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/pytest@9.1.1\",\n            \"UID\": \"c32b4cc46ab29fab\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"9.1.1\",\n          \"Relationship\": \"direct\",\n          \"DependsOn\": [\n            \"colorama@0.4.6\",\n            \"iniconfig@2.3.0\",\n            \"packaging@26.2\",\n            \"pluggy@1.6.0\",\n            \"pygments@2.20.0\"\n          ],\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"pytest-qt@4.5.0\",\n          \"Name\": \"pytest-qt\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/pytest-qt@4.5.0\",\n            \"UID\": \"b083346197a4ce8d\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"4.5.0\",\n          \"Relationship\": \"direct\",\n          \"DependsOn\": [\n            \"pluggy@1.6.0\",\n            \"pytest@9.1.1\",\n            \"typing-extensions@4.16.0\"\n          ],\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"ruff@0.16.1\",\n          \"Name\": \"ruff\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/ruff@0.16.1\",\n            \"UID\": \"866d644f33c07f20\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"0.16.1\",\n          \"Relationship\": \"direct\",\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"colorama@0.4.6\",\n          \"Name\": \"colorama\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/colorama@0.4.6\",\n            \"UID\": \"a9b0f41cf3bb79cc\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"0.4.6\",\n          \"Indirect\": true,\n          \"Relationship\": \"indirect\",\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"iniconfig@2.3.0\",\n          \"Name\": \"iniconfig\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/iniconfig@2.3.0\",\n            \"UID\": \"dbea2b4a1a557d3e\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"2.3.0\",\n          \"Indirect\": true,\n          \"Relationship\": \"indirect\",\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"packaging@26.2\",\n          \"Name\": \"packaging\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/packaging@26.2\",\n            \"UID\": \"139d7b3635829535\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"26.2\",\n          \"Indirect\": true,\n          \"Relationship\": \"indirect\",\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"pluggy@1.6.0\",\n          \"Name\": \"pluggy\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/pluggy@1.6.0\",\n            \"UID\": \"fb8af1ba97572ef7\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"1.6.0\",\n          \"Indirect\": true,\n          \"Relationship\": \"indirect\",\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"pygments@2.20.0\",\n          \"Name\": \"pygments\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/pygments@2.20.0\",\n            \"UID\": \"a97e8b3301b61131\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"2.20.0\",\n          \"Indirect\": true,\n          \"Relationship\": \"indirect\",\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"pyside6-addons@6.11.1\",\n          \"Name\": \"pyside6-addons\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/pyside6-addons@6.11.1\",\n            \"UID\": \"dcb7e6a748707838\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"6.11.1\",\n          \"Indirect\": true,\n          \"Relationship\": \"indirect\",\n          \"DependsOn\": [\n            \"pyside6-essentials@6.11.1\",\n            \"shiboken6@6.11.1\"\n          ],\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"pyside6-essentials@6.11.1\",\n          \"Name\": \"pyside6-essentials\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/pyside6-essentials@6.11.1\",\n            \"UID\": \"21fd3dffd89a486f\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"6.11.1\",\n          \"Indirect\": true,\n          \"Relationship\": \"indirect\",\n          \"DependsOn\": [\n            \"shiboken6@6.11.1\"\n          ],\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"shiboken6@6.11.1\",\n          \"Name\": \"shiboken6\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/shiboken6@6.11.1\",\n            \"UID\": \"c1fced60fd95da30\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"6.11.1\",\n          \"Indirect\": true,\n          \"Relationship\": \"indirect\",\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"ID\": \"typing-extensions@4.16.0\",\n          \"Name\": \"typing-extensions\",\n          \"Identifier\": {\n            \"PURL\": \"pkg:pypi/typing-extensions@4.16.0\",\n            \"UID\": \"23fd9c45aea880bf\"\n          },\n          \"Version\": \"4.16.0\",\n          \"Indirect\": true,\n          \"Relationship\": \"indirect\",\n          \"AnalyzedBy\": \"uv\"\n        }\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"
                    }
